      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Meta Lead Ads intake\nGET answers Meta's webhook verification (hub.challenge).\n\nPOST verifies the **X-Hub-Signature-256** HMAC against the raw body, stores every `leadgen` change in the durable inbox, answers Meta only after the insert succeeded (so Meta retries if the database is down), then processes each new event.\n\nEnv: META_VERIFY_TOKEN, META_APP_SECRET",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 7
      },
